{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25255","headline":"和丘员外题湛长史旧居 · 于頔","name":"和丘员外题湛长史旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧条历山下，水木无氛滓。\n王门结长裾，岩扃怡暮齿。\n昔贤枕高躅，今彦仰知止。\n依依瞩烟霞，眷眷返墟里。\n湛生久已没，丘也亦同耻。\n立言咸不朽，何必在青史。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于頔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25255.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25255","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}